@page
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Om os";
    ViewData["TitleEn"] = "About us";
}

<section class="faq-hero">
    <div class="wrap faq-hero-inner faq-hero-inner--text">
        <div class="faq-hero-text">
            <h1 data-en="About us">Om os</h1>
            <p data-en="A small guinea pig shop in Esbjerg, built around one idea: guinea pigs are social animals, and the shop should say so before it says anything else.">
                En lille marsvinebutik i Esbjerg, bygget omkring én idé: marsvin er
                flokdyr, og det skal butikken sige, før den siger noget andet.
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

@* The care guide's layout: chapter list on the left, chapter cards beside it. *@
<section class="section">
    <div class="wrap faq-layout">
        <nav class="faq-topics" aria-label="På denne side" data-en-aria-label="On this page">
            <h2 data-en="On this page">På denne side</h2>
            <ul>
                <li><a href="#hvad-vi-laver"><span data-en="What we do">Hvad vi laver</span><span class="faq-count">1</span></a></li>
                <li><a href="#find-os"><span data-en="Where to find us">Find os</span><span class="faq-count">2</span></a></li>
            </ul>
        </nav>

        <div class="guide-chapters">
            <article class="guide-chapter" id="hvad-vi-laver">
                <header>
                    <span class="guide-chapter-number">1</span>
                    <h2 data-en="What we do">Hvad vi laver</h2>
                </header>
                <div class="guide-points">
                    <div class="guide-point">
                        <h3 data-en="Pairs, not singles">Par, ikke enkeltdyr</h3>
                        <p data-en="We mainly rehome guinea pigs in bonded pairs, and sell the hay, cages, houses and bedding that go with them. A single guinea pig leaves the shop too, but only once you confirm it's joining a guinea pig or herd you already have — never to live alone. Every animal here is raised on the same standard described in our care guide.">
                            Vi videreformidler primært marsvin i bundne par, og sælger det
                            hø, de bure, huse og den strøelse der hører til. Et enkelt
                            marsvin kommer også herfra, men kun når du bekræfter, det
                            tilføjes et marsvin eller en flok, du allerede har — aldrig
                            for at bo alene. Hvert dyr her er opdrættet efter samme
                            standard som beskrevet i vores pasningsguide.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="guide-point">
                        <h3 data-en="Pickup">Afhentning</h3>
                        <p data-en="Guinea pigs are picked up in store, not shipped — we want to talk through the cage and setup with you first, not hand over a box.">
                            Marsvin hentes i butikken, de sendes ikke med fragt — vi vil
                            gerne nå at snakke om bur og indretning med dig først, ikke
                            bare aflevere en kasse.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </article>

            <article class="guide-chapter" id="find-os">
                <header>
                    <span class="guide-chapter-number">2</span>
                    <h2 data-en="Where to find us">Find os</h2>
                </header>
                <div class="guide-points">
                    <div class="guide-point">
                        <h3 data-en="Opening hours">Åbningstider</h3>
                        <p data-en="Esbjerg. Open Thursday and Friday 14–18, Saturday 10–14 — outside those hours, use the contact page.">
                            Esbjerg. Åbent torsdag og fredag 14–18, lørdag 10–14 — uden for
                            de tidspunkter, brug kontaktsiden.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </article>

            <aside class="guide-note">
                <h2 data-en="One honest note">Én ærlig bemærkning</h2>
                <p data-en="Marsvin is an example webshop built for a Zealand secure-coding project — not a real business, not a real shop in Esbjerg. This page is written the way a real pet shop's &quot;about us&quot; page would read, because that's the point of the exercise. See the front page footer for the same note.">
                    Marsvin er en eksempelwebshop bygget til et Zealand-projekt om
                    secure coding — ikke en rigtig forretning, ikke en rigtig
                    butik i Esbjerg. Denne side er skrevet, som en rigtig
                    dyrehandels "om os"-side ville være, fordi det er hele pointen
                    med øvelsen. Se footeren for samme bemærkning.
                </p>
            </aside>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
